msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Intendi... ⟪k:1⟫che sei una parte di Morgana?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6E4A8859_8DE0_46C7_ADD1_3C484B066284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdca4a21fdd3d9709a1614553c609446883efa38dc3aa65b36dea877418a22b6
