#: scenario9:scenario9_67E6FE66_E9AF_49A2_BAB8_937EC9E55832
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e57c90ab467fdf4f93f41cb06ff4299773140d1b73dfbcd6ce834628263d74af
