msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the flaxen-haired girl would have been able to let go of her "
"yearning for her brother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se non fossi stata lì, la ragazza dai capelli dorati avrebbe rinunciato all’amore per suo "
"fratello."

#: scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1535e9786db2c083658b70a9e0af3fd926f71c0f59d319d736c2dc2057f059da
