"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the ambitious businessman would not have been betrayed by his close "
"friend."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se non fossi stata lì, l’ambizioso uomo d’affari non sarebbe stato tradito dalla sua "
"migliore amica."

#: scenario9:scenario9_D04265D7_EB6F_45D2_AEEF_A130826FF259
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
