msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no longer a part of Morgana, but something entirely separate. ⟪k:1⟫However, I wasn’t "
"“me” yet, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ero più una parte di Morgana, ma qualcosa di completamente separato. ⟪k:1⟫Tuttavia, non "
"ero ancora “io”."

#: scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afc34ca5a9e42a1564271dd8ad8f540fc15c0a1561f9c34e57894573eb6ce78b
